    skos:definition "A person with a loose family / emotional connection that is listed by someone to be contacted in the event of death. This is a loosely defined term meant for commemoration and honour roll purposes.This term does not provide a hook for provenance information."@en ;
    foaf:name "Next Of Kin"@en .

