    skos:definition "ChorÄÅ¼y is a military rank in Poland and neighboring countries. A chorÄÅ¼y was once a knight who bore a standard â the emblem of an armed troop, a province, a land, a duchy, or the kingdom. This function later evolved into a non-hereditary noble title."@en ;
